{"pageProps":{"note":{"id":"zettel.ai.verified-done","title":"Definisi 'Done' sebagai 'Verified'","description":"Pergeseran definisi penyelesaian tugas dari 'kode telah ditulis' menjadi 'kode telah diverifikasi oleh feedback loop yang independen'.","tags":["ai-workflow","verification","loop-engineering"],"custom":{"description":"Pergeseran definisi penyelesaian tugas dari 'kode telah ditulis' menjadi 'kode telah diverifikasi oleh feedback loop yang independen'."},"fname":"zettel.ai.verified-done","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"974a748228b115998536914f6c32cc1a","updated":1782198660436,"created":1782198660436,"desc":"","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.ai.verified-done","id":"zettel.ai.verified-done","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.ai-workflow","alias":"ai-workflow","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.ai-workflow"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.ai.verified-done","id":"zettel.ai.verified-done","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.verification","alias":"verification","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.verification"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"zettel.ai.verified-done","id":"zettel.ai.verified-done","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.loop-engineering","alias":"loop-engineering","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.loop-engineering"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.ai.verified-done","id":"zettel.ai.verified-done","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"notes.ai-engineering.claude-code-loop-setup","position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":3,"offset":886},"end":{"line":18,"column":50,"offset":933},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"notes.ai-engineering.claude-code-loop-setup"}},{"type":"wiki","from":{"fname":"zettel.ai.verified-done","id":"zettel.ai.verified-done","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"zettel.ai.separation-of-maker-and-checker","position":{"start":{"line":19,"column":3,"offset":992},"end":{"line":19,"column":48,"offset":1037},"indent":[]},"xvault":false,"sameFile":false,"to":{"fname":"zettel.ai.separation-of-maker-and-checker"}},{"from":{"fname":"zettel.ai.loop-enforcement-mechanisms","id":"zettel.ai.loop-enforcement-mechanisms","vaultName":"vault"},"type":"backlink","position":{"start":{"line":17,"column":3,"offset":1255},"end":{"line":17,"column":30,"offset":1282},"indent":[]},"value":"zettel.ai.verified-done"}],"anchors":{"konsep":{"type":"header","text":"Konsep","value":"konsep","line":15,"column":0,"depth":2},"mengapa-ini-penting":{"type":"header","text":"Mengapa Ini Penting?","value":"mengapa-ini-penting","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2},"implementasi":{"type":"header","text":"Implementasi","value":"implementasi","line":26,"column":0,"depth":2},"relasi":{"type":"header","text":"Relasi","value":"relasi","line":30,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":[],"parent":"5u5qgf55dk7a3bauxh68b69","data":{}},"body":"<h1 id=\"definisi-done-sebagai-verified\">Definisi 'Done' sebagai 'Verified'<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#definisi-done-sebagai-verified\"></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"konsep\">Konsep<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#konsep\"></a></h2>\n<p>Dalam workflow tradisional, seorang developer merasa selesai ketika implementasi fitur telah ditulis. Namun, dalam AI-driven development, kecepatan generate kode membuat \"penulisan\" menjadi trivial.</p>\n<p><strong>Verified Done</strong> adalah standar di mana sebuah tugas dianggap selesai hanya jika:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Implementasi telah ditulis.</li>\n<li>Seluruh check (tests, linter, typecheck) telah dijalankan dalam session tersebut.</li>\n<li>Output verifikasi menunjukkan status 'Pass'.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"mengapa-ini-penting\">Mengapa Ini Penting?<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#mengapa-ini-penting\"></a></h2>\n<p>Tanpa definisi ini, agent cenderung mengalami \"hallucination of completion\"—merasa sudah selesai karena kodenya terlihat benar secara sintaksis, padahal secara behavior gagal.</p>\n<h2 id=\"implementasi\">Implementasi<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#implementasi\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Stop Hooks</strong>: Memaksa eksekusi verifikasi tepat sebelum agent bisa mengirim pesan \"Done\".</li>\n<li><strong>Evidence-Based Reporting</strong>: Mewajibkan agent melampirkan output terminal sebagai bukti verifikasi.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"relasi\">Relasi<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#relasi\"></a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/notes.ai-engineering.claude-code-loop-setup\">Practical Loop Setup in Claude Code: From Messenger to Reviewer</a>: Implementasi praktis menggunakan hooks di Claude Code.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.ai.separation-of-maker-and-checker\">Pemisahan Maker dan Checker dalam Verifikasi AI</a>: Memastikan verifikasi dilakukan oleh checker yang independen.</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"tags\">Tags<a aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"anchor-heading icon-link\" href=\"#tags\"></a></h2>\n<ol>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">ai-workflow (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">verification (Private)</a></li>\n<li><a title=\"Private\" href=\"https://wiki.dendron.so/notes/hfyvYGJZQiUwQaaxQO27q.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"private\">loop-engineering (Private)</a></li>\n</ol>\n<hr>\n<strong>Backlinks</strong>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/sotoy/notes/zettel.ai.loop-enforcement-mechanisms\">Mekanisme Penegakan Loop (Loop Enforcement)</a></li>\n</ul>","noteIndex":{"id":"root","title":"Hello and Welcome! 👋","desc":"","updated":1778468084907,"created":1724251163400,"tags":["x","twitter"],"custom":{"nav_order":0,"permalink":"/"},"fname":"root","type":"note","vault":{"fsPath":"vault"},"contentHash":"fbada016be66dbd4790f7e49ede05b67","links":[{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.x","alias":"x","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.x"}},{"type":"frontmatterTag","from":{"fname":"root","id":"root","vaultName":"vault"},"value":"tags.twitter","alias":"twitter","xvault":false,"to":{"fname":"tags.twitter"}}],"anchors":{"find-more":{"type":"header","text":"Find More","value":"find-more","line":23,"column":0,"depth":2}},"children":["book-summaries","daily","handbook","notes","tags","til","zettel"],"parent":null,"data":{},"body":"\nWelcome to the homepage! I use Dendron to store and organize notes, ideas, and experiments I’m working on. Here are the main sections you’ll find on this site:\n\n1. **Learning Notes** — Practical notes on programming, recent technologies, and productivity tips.\n2. **Personal Projects** — Summaries of projects, experiments, and outcomes I’m working on or have completed.\n3. **Writings & Opinions** — Casual articles and reflections about technology, daily life, and other interesting topics.\n\nI’m constantly experimenting and learning. I hope the content here helps you as a reference, a starting point for discussion, or just light reading.\n\n> Why Dendron?\n>\nDendron helps keep notes organized. Its \"seed\" and \"vault\" concepts make it easy to structure content and find what you need.\n\n## Find More\n\nIf you want to learn more or connect, check these links:\n\n- [Homepage (Dendron)](https://zeihanaulia.github.io/sotoy/)\n- [My GitHub](https://github.com/zeihanaulia)\n- [My Twitter / X](https://x.com/zeihanaulia)\n\nThanks for stopping by. If you have feedback or want to chat, feel free to reach out.\n"},"collectionChildren":null,"customHeadContent":null,"config":{"version":5,"dev":{"enablePreviewV2":true},"commands":{"lookup":{"note":{"selectionMode":"extract","confirmVaultOnCreate":true,"vaultSelectionModeOnCreate":"smart","leaveTrace":false,"bubbleUpCreateNew":true,"fuzzThreshold":0.2}},"randomNote":{},"insertNoteLink":{"aliasMode":"none","enableMult